  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MultiDonor Trust Fund for Cofinancing of the Public Expenditures for Administrative Capacity Endurance in Ukraine Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&quot;The objective of the Trust Fund is to co-finance Bank-supported
 Public Expenditures for Administrative Capacity Endurance in Ukraine Project (PEACE) (P178946) (the Project), which aims to contribute to sustaining Ukraine&apos;s administrative and service delivery capacity to exercise core government functions at the national and regional levels.&quot;</narrative>
  </description>
